Package: substances
Title: Substance-Aware Unit Conversions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Bill", "Denney", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "wdenney@humanpredictions.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5759-428X"))
Description: Unit conversions that depend on a property of the substance being
    measured. The 'units' package converts between commensurable units, but
    cannot convert mg/dL to mmol/L because that requires the analyte's molar
    mass. This package attaches a substance to each element of a vector,
    supplies the substance-specific quantities (molar mass, density, valence,
    biological activity) that bridge otherwise incommensurable dimensions, and
    refuses to convert or combine quantities of different substances unless the
    relationship is explicitly defined. Reference data ships as CSV with a
    citation for every value.
